flowchart LR
    CODE[Code Change\nor New Implementation] --> L1

    subgraph L1["Layer 1: /review"]
        R1[Developer reads every diff\nComprehension gate passed\nbefore merging]
    end

    subgraph L2["Layer 2: /verify"]
        R2[Slash command confirms\ndesign assumptions understood\nAdded after production scoring incident]
    end

    subgraph L3["Layer 3: /code-review"]
        R3[Independent AI Code Reviewer\nArchitectural review\nSeparate from implementer]
    end

    subgraph L4["Layer 4: pip-audit"]
        R4[Dependency vulnerability scan\nReport-only mode\nNo automated fixes — manual upgrade path]
    end

    subgraph L5["Layer 5: Security Sweep"]
        R5[Independent AI Security Reviewer\n/sec-sweep on trigger\n/sec-batch for full audit\nAST-based static analysis]
    end

    L1 --> L2 --> L3 --> L4 --> L5 --> MERGE[Ready to Merge]

    style L1 fill:#4a90d9,color:#fff
    style L2 fill:#e8a838,color:#fff
    style L3 fill:#d96a4a,color:#fff
    style L4 fill:#7b68ae,color:#fff
    style L5 fill:#5ba585,color:#fff
